---
title: A delivery pipeline
---
flowchart LR
  Push([Push to main]) --> Lint
  subgraph Check["Check"]
    Lint[Lint and format] --> Unit[Unit tests]
    Lint --> Audit[Audit dependencies]
  end
  subgraph Build["Build"]
    Linux[Linux binary]
    Arm[ARM binary]
    Docs[Documentation]
  end
  Unit --> Linux
  Unit --> Arm
  Audit --> Linux
  Unit --> Docs
  subgraph Ship["Ship"]
    Sign[Sign the release] --> Stage[(Staging)]
    Stage --> Smoke{Smoke tests pass?}
    Smoke -->|yes| Prod[(Production)]
    Smoke -->|no| Rollback[Roll back]
  end
  Linux --> Sign
  Arm --> Sign
  Docs --> Site[Publish the site]
  Rollback -.-> Push
  Prod --> Notify([Tell the team])
